# oracle: fix indent side in (w60fix_indent_side_in): a sphere of radius 3.5 lattice units centred in an LJ sc solid pulls
# the atoms outside it back toward the centre (side in acts on atoms with r > R, energy K/3 (r - R)^3); the centre is a
# moving variable (equal-style, evaluated each step), units lattice. Measured against native LAMMPS (black box) per step.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units lj
dimension 3
boundary f f f
atom_style atomic
lattice sc 1.0
region box block -6 6 -6 6 -6 6 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass * 1.0
pair_style lj/cut 1.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
velocity all set 0.0 0.0 0.0 sum no units box
fix 1 all nve
variable yc equal "0.02*sin(0.3*step)"
fix 2 all indent 2.0 sphere 0.0 v_yc 0.0 3.5 units lattice side in
timestep 0.005
thermo_style custom step atoms pe ke
thermo_modify format float %.15g lost ignore
thermo 10
run 60
